msgctxt "680"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for somebody. All I know is he's been seen on Taihei Boulevard "
"East."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "You're talking about a pretty large area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"And one of the most dangerous, too⑬especially around the deserted parking "
"lot by the entrance to the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like I'm going to have to check out this deserted parking lot.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san. How's it going?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Hey. I've heard some dangerous guys have been seen lately in West Park. You "
"know anything about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "West Park? Oh, that small park by Purgatory?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"That park's not the only place. Kamurocho's full of those dangerous types. "
"You could probably pass for one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Anyway, we'd better be careful, especially at night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. Here you are again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Hey. You're always here, too, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Not always. I like to get around and have fun, too, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"I actually went bowling the other day, but I was surprised about how many "
"older people were there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"I didn't know so many middle-aged people played. It was a bit of a shock, "
"really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"(So older people wouldn't look out of place in a bowling alley, then..)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"(So only people authorized by the Kazama Family have access to the "
"Millennium Tower roof...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"(The HLA is under the Kazama Family's control... I'll try talking to one of "
"Ibuki's men.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm looking for a place where I can get a panoramic view of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "A panoramic view? Planning a hot date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"In any case, the roof of the Millennium Tower would give you a real nice "
"view."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "The roof of the Millennium Tower... of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"(I doubt Shu could hit anybody in the city from way up on the Millennium "
"Tower roof. I don't care how good of a sniper he is...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"But if I'm remembering right, access to the roof is usually closed off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"The Kazama Family Office is on the top floor, and they don't allow "
"unauthorized people up there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"(The HLA is under the Kazama Family's control... I'll try talking to one of "
"Ibuki's men.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Well, sorry to bother you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. Looking for somebody again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "Yeah, something like that. Have you ever been to Public Park 3?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "How old do you think I am? You think I hang out at parks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "That place is crawling with kids. Wouldn't go near it if you paid me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid ""
"(The Reaper Hasutani seems to be operating in the park... but how can he do "
"what he does with kids around?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, there you are again! You must have an awful lot of time on your "
"hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "Not as much as you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Touché. But hey, it could always be worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"What about all those lazy-ass dudes who do nothing but chill in front of the"
" theater all the time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"Sometimes I even see those tough wannabe thugs over there. It's pretty "
"funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid ""
"(Thugs hanging out in front of the theater? I bet they're easy to spot.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. I've got something to tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"Man came by on his way back from the bathhouse. Said there were all these "
"shady guys on Park Boulevard, and they were up to something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"Maybe this guy was dizzy from staying in the bath too long or something, but"
" he couldn't really tell me what exactly happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "But nothing out of the ordinary for this city, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like something went down somewhere around the bathhouse on Park "
"Boulevard.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"(Maybe it has something to do with the hitman Zen. I should check it out...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Hey. What would you say is the most deserted place in this city?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"Y'know that's a really suspicious question right? I know you're a good guy, "
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"I'd say it gets pretty deserted as soon as you go north of Shichifuku "
"Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"Especially back behind the Yoshida Batting Center. It's so deserted, it's "
"like the place is haunted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid ""
"(Behind Yoshida Batting Center... There's a construction site around "
"there...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. You come here a lot, now, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Now that you mention it, how come you're always here playing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "Well, the Millennium Tower is kind of like the symbol of Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "A lot of tourists come to see it, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"They even stop to listen to my songs. I guess I'm part of the local "
"\"color.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid ""
"People from around here, though... They don't have any interest in street "
"musicians like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid ""
"(He's right. First-time visitors to Kamurocho will probably want to visit "
"the Millennium Tower.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. Can't get enough of my singing, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid "Uh, not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "You're supposed to say, \"Yes, I love it!\" even if you don't mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid ""
"Aw, I've had enough of singing for now. Maybe I'll go get something to eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "Kiryu-san, wanna go have some yakitori with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid "Yakitori? Wouldn't have guessed that was your scene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid "Hey, c'mon! Yakitori...? Skewering stuff and grilling it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "What could be more rock-'n'-roll than that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "...Can't say I follow your logic there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1616"
msgid ""
"Whatever. There's a great yakitori place on Senryo Avenue, across from that "
"big office building."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1628"
msgid "C'mon. You can treat me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1640"
msgid "Sorry. You'll have to ask somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1652"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "Mpf."

msgctxt "1664"
msgid ""
"(The big office building on Senryo Avenue... Could Samejima's office be "
"there?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1676"
msgid "(Across from the yakitori place, huh? Guess I'll go take a look.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. Listen to this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1712"
msgid ""
"When I came out of the men's room at the park earlier, these punks started "
"harassing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1724"
msgid "They were all, \"Drop the fuckin' 'innocent' bit!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1736"
msgid ""
"But I'd just come out of the men's room. How else was I supposed to look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1748"
msgid ""
"Why do they have to harass people because of the way they look, anyway? "
"Hmph..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Quindi, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "1784"
msgid ""
"You came at kind of a bad time for me. Sorry, but I'm in a crappy mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1796"
msgid "I see. Sorry, then."
msgstr "Capisco. Scusa, allora."

msgctxt "1808"
msgid "Nothing ever seems to go right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1820"
msgid "Well, maybe I'll see you some other time, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1844"
msgid "Oh, hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1856"
msgid "This isn't very good, but just listen for a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1880"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1892"
msgid "Like my song?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1904"
msgid "Well, I'm no expert, but I'd say it wasn't bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1916"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "1928"
msgid "No matter how much I play here, nobody ever listens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1940"
msgid "But I guess it doesn't really matter if anybody listens or not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1952"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1964"
msgid "Sorry about that. Didn't mean to complain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1976"
msgid "It's all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988"
msgid "I'm Hideki, by the way. A washed-up musician, as you can see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2000"
msgid "And you are?"
msgstr "E tu sei?"

msgctxt "2012"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2024"
msgid "Kiryu? Where have I heard that name before...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2036"
msgid "Meh, I guess Kiryu is a pretty common name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2048"
msgid "You're the only Kiryu-san who's ever stopped to hear me sing, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2060"
msgid "Thanks for listening."
msgstr "Grazie per avermi ascoltato."

msgctxt "2072"
msgid "You can usually find me here. Come by and listen again sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2084"
msgid "Sure, if I get the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2096"
msgid "Sorry to keep you. See you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2144"
msgid "So, did you come to see me about something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2156"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure if you're the one to ask, but I'm looking for a place where I "
"can get a panoramic view of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2168"
msgid "What, looking for a good date spot or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2180"
msgid ""
"In any case, the roof of the Millennium Tower would give you a real nice "
"view."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2192"
msgid "The roof of the Millennium Tower... of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2204"
msgid ""
"(I doubt Shu could hit anybody in the city from way up on the Millennium "
"Tower roof. I don't care how good of a sniper he is...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2216"
msgid "But if I recall, I think access to the roof is usually closed off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2228"
msgid ""
"The Kazama Family Office is on the top floor, and they don't allow "
"unauthorized people up there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2240"
msgid ""
"(The HLA is under the Kazama Family's control... I'll try talking to one of "
"Ibuki's men.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2252"
msgid "Well, sorry to bother you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20220"
msgid "Hideki"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20224"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20228"
msgid "Talk_Udekumi_st"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20232"
msgid "Talk_Udekumi_ed"
msgstr ""

